                                "sense_id": "d30aa8c4-3e00-3130-834a-b78bc0fc9ec6",
                                "text": "We had seen Tish's apartment change from a sedate and spinsterly retreat to a riot of lace covers on the mantel, on the backs of chairs, on the stands, on the pillows--everywhere."
